### BetTicker Endpoints (3+)

**Pattern:** Exact pathname or prefix match

```typescript
if (url.pathname === '/cloud/api/Manager/getBetTicker') {
  // Transparent proxy + KV interception
  // Handler: handleBetTickerInterception()
  // Location: src/interceptors/bet-ticker-sniffer.ts
  // Returns: Original API response (with side-effect KV storage)
}

if (url.pathname.startsWith('/interceptor/')) {
  // BetTicker history/analysis API
  // Handler: handleInterceptorAPI()
  // Routes:
  //   - /interceptor/history?limit=100
  //   - /interceptor/response?key=...
  //   - /interceptor/stats
}
```

**Used By:** Browser extension, all dashboards

**Documentation:** [docs/BET_TICKER_SNIFFER.md](mdc:docs/BET_TICKER_SNIFFER.md)

