## Queue & Cron Integration

### Queue Consumers

**Handler:** `async queue(batch: MessageBatch, env: Env, ctx: ExecutionContext)`

**Routes:**
```typescript
if (batch.queue === 'line-ingress') {
  await handleLineIngress(message, env, ctx);
}
if (batch.queue === 'steam-webhook') {
  await handleSteamWebhook(message, env, ctx);
}
```

**Location:** [src/queues/](mdc:src/queues/)

---

### Scheduled Jobs

**Handler:** `async scheduled(event: ScheduledEvent, env: Env, ctx: ExecutionContext)`

**Routes:**
```typescript
if (event.cron === '0 * * * *') {
  // Hourly sharp calculation
  await handleSharpCalculation(env, ctx);
}
if (event.cron === '*/30 * * * * *') {
  // 30-second exposure calculation (actually every minute due to CF limitations)
  await handleExposureCalculation(env, ctx);
}
```

**Location:** [src/schedules/](mdc:src/schedules/)

**Documentation:** [docs/DATABASE_CRON_VERIFICATION.md](mdc:docs/DATABASE_CRON_VERIFICATION.md)

